  "description": "When I threw up in front of my first love who confessed to me, the one who came to me was... my first love's older brother?\n\nI have this habit of throwing up when I get nervous. One day, my first love, whom I'd liked for so long, confessed to me, and I ended up throwing up right in front of them. I was drowning my sorrows in alcohol when someone appeared before me. It was my first love's older brother, Hyun-Seok. After pouring out everything I could and couldn't say to him, the alcohol made my memory fade... \n\nWhen I opened my eyes again, lying next to me was... none other than my friend's brother, completely naked?!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
